# Backend (tourism-backend)

- Architecture: presentation → application → domain; infrastructure implements ports.
- Domain/application must not import FastAPI, SQLAlchemy engines, or AI provider SDKs.
- Dependencies: `uv add` / `uv add --dev` (or optional-dependencies); commit `uv.lock`; never hand-edit lock.
- Type hints on public application/domain functions; MyPy strict; no bare `type: ignore`.
- Ruff for format + lint; no Black/isort/flake8 alongside.
- Prefer enums/Literals over magic strings; timezone-aware datetimes; structured logging (no `print`).
- Style: `tourism-platform/docs/python-code-style.md`.
- Security: any new/changed endpoint that takes client input needs bounds +
  security regression coverage (`tests/security`); ORM/bound params only.
  See always-on `security-baseline` rule and `docs/security/`.
- After changes: `./scripts/validate.sh` or `make backend-check`; if API/input
  touched also `uv run pytest tests/security`.
